Atty. Lorna Patajo-Kapunan: Thank

00:20:51.020 --> 00:21:16.880
Atty. Lorna Patajo-Kapunan: you, thank you, sir presiding judge, justice, senator, judge. We yield to the wisdom of your decision. With that, we will reserve the right. We are not waiving the right to do call her at the appropriate time and to do file the appropriate request for subpoena duces tecum and subpoena ad testificandum

00:21:45.050 --> 00:21:55.310
Atty. Gerville “Jinky Bitrics” R. Luistro: Atty. Tessie C. Candom To the head prosecutor of Article 4 that is threat, the Hon. Lawrence Defensor, may I request that he be recognized, Your Honor.

00:21:57.110 --> 00:22:07.650
