Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: Thank you for the interruption, Congressman.

00:24:18.360 --> 00:24:36.500
Sen. Francis “Chiz” Escudero: And we will be scheduling it for oral arguments by the parties. If that is the desire of the Honorable Senator Judge Cayetano, we will do the same with respect to this once the motion has been filed formally by the panel of prosecutors. The Honorable Defensor is recognized. You may proceed, Sir.

