00:26:54.590 --> 00:27:15.780
Sen. Francis “Chiz” Escudero: Although indeed we will interpret the rules liberally, and although indeed this is a sui generis proceeding, neither will we allow any dilatory moves and or tactics, and I will bind and hold you to your five minutes, Honorable Defensor. Absolutely, Your Honor. Clockit. We will afford the same opportunity to the Counsel for Respondent when their turn arrives.

